<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Costco upped to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Costco upped to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Barbara Miller upgraded Costco Cos Inc to a strong buy from a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
